# Vulnerability details

## Impact
Two ways to purchase the ``CollateralTracker`` token is through the ``mint()`` and ``deposit()`` functions. 
Both functions run a deposit process, however while ``mint()`` requires you to specify the amount of shares to be received, the ``deposit()`` requires you to specify the amount of assets to be transferred in.

However, the ``mint()`` and ``deposit()`` functions provide different values to users for the same amount of tokens provided. 

## Proof of Concept
