# Vulnerability details

## Impact

Inaccurate accounting, The Pool will think it has more asset than it really has.

## Proof of Concept
The `CollaterTracker.sol` contract doesn't handle Fee On Transfer Token Well. For example when depositing Collateral the `asset` is used to mint shares, this `asset` value is also used to store the `s_poolAssets`. The `s_poolAssets` is also used to calculate the `totalAssets()` this will lead to Inaccurate accounting. As with Fee On Transfer Token the amount of token received is less than the `assets` value.

